      {
        "heading_raw": "Benefit",
        "body_raw": "When you summon one or more animals, humanoids, or vermin using a summon nature’s ally spell (or an effect that mimics such a spell), instead of granting them the benefit from Augment Summoning, you can instead apply one of the following templates to them: aerial, aqueous, chthonic, fiery, or primordial. If you summon multiple creatures with one casting, they must all have the same template."
      }
